SELECTED_OUTPUT
-reset         false
-distance         false
-file          out.dat

USER_PUNCH

-headings  time_d cell pH pe Ca C4 Cl Na Mg
1	PUNCH sim_time/86400
2	PUNCH cell_no
4	PUNCH -LA("H+")
6	PUNCH -LA("e-")
7	PUNCH TOT("Ca")
10	PUNCH TOT("C(4)")
11	PUNCH TOT("Cl")
12	PUNCH TOT("Na")
13	PUNCH TOT("Mg")
